   "claim": "'Aún aprendo' (I am still learning), Bordeaux album G.54, c. 1824–28 (Prado: c. 1826, D04151): an old man with a long beard leaning on two sticks, the motto written above him; long considered a self-portrait",
   "source": "https://fundaciongoyaenaragon.es/eng/obra/aun-aprendo-g-54/1753 ; https://www.museodelprado.es/en/the-collection/art-work/i-am-still-learning/f0c1615c-8c5f-4e80-b7bc-702ec9f4d2f3"
